  "title": "Herbal Shrimp Delight with Beer Sauce",
  "description": "A fabulous blend of herbs and greens serves as the bed for sauteed jumbo shrimp smothered with a beer and tomato sauce, and topped with freshly grated Parmesan cheese.",
